					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730710409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 730710409,
					"content": "可是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730710410
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730710410,
					"content": "#好啦，派蒙和{NICKNAME}不用那麼擔心我，之前我不也一個人過得好好的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730710411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 730710411,
					"content": "而且，我可是很擅長照顧花草的，如果能讓這裡的苗圃更加繁盛，「蘭那羅」們也會高興的吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730710412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 730710412,
